  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strenghtening Equity, Access and Quality in Education 2 (SEAQE2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth in East Shewa and West Arsi Zones in Ethiopia will access, engage and learn in inclusive, quality and relevant learning environments on relevant knowledge, attitudes, values and life skills and 21st century skills.  The result being that youth gain knowledge, skills and values to become productive and responsible citizens. This targets IDPs, refugees, host community children,  children with disabilities, minorities and those living in remote areas.</narrative>
  </description>
